\n(-\\infty ,2)\\cup (2,\\infty )\n$$\n\nand the function is also continuous on these intervals." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-76069/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "eac988ba-ea97-52c7-90a7-d451ee7f49e5"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-76069"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-105478/selection/341967967373c4b2d868400f09bea398da10be2b2776117fe669ebd7f3bbdabe" :answer/id #uuid "d9c06a7e-5bc1-529c-a385-4ff4892eb7c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-\\infty ,\\frac{1}{6})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105478/selection/73e5166a8c37dcad7b2ad412a74073f5cae84c301a86a5d7665ac291a772f334" :answer/id #uuid "4ad8ecfc-4584-51ae-98ce-1e89057e918d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[6,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105478/selection/803c6b3abb8793f9d6e656cd9b336a2d579318450b338a63df51e84b17d61752" :answer/id #uuid "dc2c4429-aab3-56a2-8b60-f4888dac6365" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-\\infty ,6)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105478/selection/5289c72c192f3414b3ca013fa18cca966780cd33390cc8ef24c8e6c341c7f843" :answer/id #uuid "f93c4250-078a-5f1f-a73f-c10bc8b22cfc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-\\infty ,\\frac{1}{6}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105478/selection/1ca3da67966bb65427300015b47c629ecaee7486c32b82ee2206c0b6788e76dd" :answer/id #uuid "cd9cec0c-8fb4-5b2f-8851-6a18c358fc52" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{1}{6},\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105478/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "64c55b1d-e216-5bf7-b4f9-8e7537034f22" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-105478/selection/341967967373c4b2d868400f09bea398da10be2b2776117fe669ebd7f3bbdabe" :answer-field/choices ["q-105478/selection/341967967373c4b2d868400f09bea398da10be2b2776117fe669ebd7f3bbdabe" "q-105478/selection/73e5166a8c37dcad7b2ad412a74073f5cae84c301a86a5d7665ac291a772f334" "q-105478/selection/803c6b3abb8793f9d6e656cd9b336a2d579318450b338a63df51e84b17d61752" "q-105478/selection/5289c72c192f3414b3ca013fa18cca966780cd33390cc8ef24c8e6c341c7f843" "q-105478/selection/1ca3da67966bb65427300015b47c629ecaee7486c32b82ee2206c0b6788e76dd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-105478" :question/id #uuid "ee7ffabe-8459-55eb-9ebc-f1c0c89dd1a2" :question/math-academy-id "q-105478" :question/problem "Find the largest interval of continuity for the function $f(x)=\\operatorname{log}⁡(3-18x).$" :question/worked-solution "The logarithmic function $\\operatorname{log}⁡(3-18x)$ is continuous at all points in its domain. However, the logarithm is only defined for positive inputs, so to find its domain, we set the expression inside the logarithm to be greater than zero:\n\n$$\n3-18x>0\\,⟹\\,18x<3\\,⟹\\,x<\\frac{1}{6}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the function $f(x)=\\operatorname{log}⁡(3-18x)$ is continuous on the interval $(-\\infty ,\\frac{1}{6}).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-105478/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0c9958ee-c8b0-5d33-8755-e61cb445b0de"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-105478"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-340069/field-1/e7bc415b91e8e2558c763c56ce6657ae30e51a7e3c0c90c1d4cd29cdacdf8934" :answer/id #uuid "0c7d0675-605a-5108-87b1-92aa89feb0ba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\infty" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340069/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "e741bdde-6e51-5645-b1e9-e95ec0d909a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340069/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "fe0aa779-56b8-54c6-9b22-3c3e38b4f730" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-340069